  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2224\">\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2054\"><strong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2052\">Upregulated Oncogenic miRNAs (e.g., miR-21, miR-155):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2224\">\n<li data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2129\">\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2129\">May indicate <strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2126\">tumor progression, inflammation, or active disease</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2224\">\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2224\">Used as <strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2179\">prognostic and diagnostic markers</strong> in various cancers (lung, GI, breast, etc.).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2388\">\n<p data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2304\"><strong data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2302\">Downregulated Tumor Suppressor miRNAs (e.g., miR-34a, miR-200 family):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2388\">\n<li data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2388\">\n<p data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2388\">Suggests <strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2348\">loss of regulatory control</strong>; can correlate with <strong data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2387\">poor prognosis</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2545\">\n<p data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2411\"><strong data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2409\">Clinical Use:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2545\">\n<li data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2545\">\n<p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2545\">To aid in <strong data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2481\">diagnosis, prognosis, treatment response monitoring</strong> (must be interpreted with clinical and pathological context).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
